1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,066
Welcome to the P F A document intelligence workspace.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:14,102
The local demo needs no cloud credentials. Create an account to open the chatbot workspace.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:23,100
Choose a provider, add metadata, and start the queue. The file is uploaded, processed, and indexed.

4
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:31,100
Ask about the brief. The answer cites its source and identifies Casablanca, English, French, and Arabic.

5
00:00:31,150 --> 00:00:36,132
You can also generate a downloadable text summary from the indexed content.

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:43,954
Metadata filters narrow retrieval. Saved chat sessions let you return to earlier questions and answers.

7
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:52,418
The document library shows the indexed file, its processing status, and metadata.

8
00:00:54,400 --> 00:01:00,798
Settings show the account and API routes. Signing in again restores the workspace.

9
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:13,430
In production, dedicated services handle storage, parsing, vision fallback, retrieval, and database records. This walkthrough uses one local API.
